Before starting the service, create or import keys in the signer's base
directory (DATADIR in #{etc}/octez/octez-signer.conf), e.g.:
  octez-signer -d ~/.tezos-signer gen keys mykey
The service serves HTTP on 127.0.0.1:6732 by default. Edit
#{etc}/octez/octez-signer.conf to listen elsewhere, enable the high
watermark check (HWM_CHECK) and restrict the magic bytes it will sign.
The service log, #{var}/log/octez/octez-signer.log, only gets warnings
(LOG_RULES in the conf file). Full logs are in <base-dir>/logs/octez-signer.
